pace for today'. Below it: 'One claim per day. Claims can't be cancelled.' 3) Notification permission tile: 'Push notifications on — we'll alert you when spaces are released.' 4) 'My vehicles' summary: 'BKX-482 · Toyota Corolla · White' with a link to the profile. Success state: the card changes to 'You're parked for today — Space B2-14, Floor B2', 'Claimed 08:02:41 PKT', 'Plate on record: BKX-482'. Error state: an alert reading 'Someone claimed the last space first. 0 spaces available now.' with the refreshed count. Empty state: '0 spaces available — we'll notify you if a space is released.' with the claim button disabled. Loading state: the button reads 'Claiming…'.","S-5":"Dashboard for an employee with a dedicated parking space. Use off-black (#18181B) for text, not pure black. Sections in order: 1) Header 'Hello, Ayesha Siddiqui' with 'Your space: B1-03 · Floor B1'. 2) Today's card for 'Tuesday, 10 June 2025' with a status badge. Normal state: badge 'Not released' and a primary button 'Release today's space', plus the note 'Releases made before 08:00 PKT become claimable at 08:00. Releases at or after 08:00 are claimable immediately.' 3) Upcoming releases list: 'Thu 12 Jun 2025 — Reserved', 'Mon 16 Jun 2025 — Reserved', and a link 'Schedule releases'. Success state: a toast 'Released'; today's badge shows 'Reserved' with 'Claimable at 08:00 PKT' (if released at 07:15), and the release button is replaced by 'Released for today'. Show status badge variants: 'Reserved', 'Claimable', 'Claimed — by an employee at 08:03 PKT'. Error state: 'You've already released 10 Jun 2025.' Loading state: the button reads 'Releasing…'.","S-6":"Page where a dedicated holder picks one or more future dates to release their space, up to 30 calendar days ahead. Use off-black (#18181B) for text, not pure black. Sections in order: 1) Heading 'Schedule releases for Space B1-03' and the note 'Scheduled releases become claimable at 08:00 PKT on each date.' 2) A multi-select calendar from 11