id not enter'; '08:12:30 · KHI-5531 · Temporary · Not verified — no claim today · Pending'. 4) Note: 'Motorcycles and pedestrians are ignored.' Error state: a red outage banner 'Camera offline since 08:25 — no automated authorization, green indicator disabled. Outage event recorded.' Empty state: 'No car detections yet today.'","S-9":"Admin page for entering and maintaining the parking-space inventory. Use off-black (#18181B) for text, not pure black. Sections in order: 1) Heading 'Parking spaces' with the count '42 spaces · 3 floors' and buttons 'Add space' and 'Import launch records (CSV)'. 2) Filters: Floor (B1, B2, B3) and Holder (Assigned / Unassigned). 3) Table with columns Space, Floor, Dedicated holder, Actions. Rows: 'B1-03 · B1 · Ayesha Siddiqui (F3-0921) · Edit'; 'B2-14 · B2 · — (pool) · Edit'; 'B3-07 · B3 · Usman Tariq (F3-0455) · Edit'. 4) Side panel form 'Edit space B1-03' with fields Space code, Floor, Dedicated holder (employee search). Validation state: 'Space code B1-03 already exists.' Empty state: 'No spaces yet — add your first space or import launch records.'"},"theme":{"bodyFont":"PUBLIC_SANS","colorMode":"LIGHT","customColor":"#1F6F5C","headlineFont":"HANKEN_GROTESK","roundness":"ROUND_EIGHT"}},"theme":{"brand":"#1F6F5C","charts":"soft","chrome":"plain","density":"comfortable","families":{"body":"Public Sans","heading":"Hanken Grotesk"},"font":"sans","fx":"modern","heading":"match","hero":"none","imagery":"mixed","mark":"glyph","mode":"light","mood":"Sign-in with Folio3 Google Workspace (S-","motion":"lively","neutral":"cool","radius":"soft","shell":"auto","surface":"flat"},"themeSource":"new"}